<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Sinophil Q2 net up 1,136 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sinophil Q2 net up 1,136 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			     54.59 vs 4.42</p>
<p>    Revenues from interest income    53.41 vs 4.81</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Sinophil Corp, an oil exploration firm recently converted into a holding company. The company said it invested in gaming activities and property development.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8939 Fax 817--6267</p>
